o;s 5 grids in Lafayette Parish came in under 90% of normal in April to May in 39 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, that same middle ran 176% of normal in May to June and just 46% in October to November. Grid 12151 had its driest year in 1954 at 59% of normal. A preliminary estimate for grid 12151 puts August to September 2026 at 55.3, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
